          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;THIS TAKES PLACE AFTER MY OTHER FANFIC, SHE-RA: MASTERS OF THE UNIVERSE.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;With the Dark He-Man defeated and the god of Death destroyed, Catra and Adora make good on the promise they made to each other at Scorpiaâ€™s first ball, taking the Vow in the place they first declared their love for one another-The Heart of Etheria. Deciding to visit Catraâ€™s long lost homeworld of Elysia as their honeymoon, Catra and Adora soon find themselves in the middle of a tense reunion between two ancient civilizations: Catraâ€™s people, the MadgÄ“cots and the people of Empyrea, who send a mysterious warrior as their emissaryâ€”Veth, bearer of Zhe-La.&lt;br /&gt;Meanwhile, back on Etheria, Glimmer stumbles upon an ancient evil on nearby Eternia, buried under a place called Grayskullâ€¦&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
